    "title": "Archbishop Ryan's Matt Johnson commits to IUP despite injury adversity - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Matt Allibone ,\n13 hours ago –– — Matt Johnson couldn’t help but let the worst-case scenarios pop into his head. Last April, the Archbishop Ryan point guard broke his ankle during an offseason workout. That meant no Philly Live, no AAU season and no showcasing himself for college coaches leading into his senior season. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
